{'symbol': 'T', 'date': '2021-04-30 10:41:00', 'title': 'AT&T ANNOUNCES PRELIMINARY RESULTS OF 2021 ANNUAL MEETING', 'text': "DALLAS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AT ITS ANNUAL MEETING OF STOCKHOLDERS TODAY, AT&T INC.* (NYSE:T) ANNOUNCED THAT EACH OF THE 12 NOMINEES TO THE COMPANY'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS WERE REELECTED FOR ONE-YEAR TERMS. THE BOARD MEMBERS ARE: WILLIAM KENNARD SAMUEL DI PIAZZA, JR. SCOTT FORD GLENN HUTCHINS DEBRA LEE STEPHEN LUCZO MICHAEL MCCALLISTER BETH MOONEY MATTHEW ROSE JOHN STANKEY CYNTHIA TAYLOR GEOFFREY YANG\xa0 ADDITIONALLY, AT&T STOCKHOLDERS VOTED TO APPROVE THE APPOINTMENT OF ERNST & YOUNG LLP AS"}